# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Cadence is a single-page Angular app: deep links (candidate token routes like
# /schedule, /status, /booking, /confirm, /feedback, and the authenticated /app/*)
# have no matching static file, so without this rule Cloudflare Pages returns 404.
# Rewrite every unmatched path to index.html with a 200 so the Angular router can
# resolve the route client-side (unknown routes render the noindex NotFoundComponent).
#
# Precedence on Cloudflare Pages: real static assets (/assets/*, *.js, *.css,
# favicon, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, _headers) AND any Pages Function (the
# same-origin /api, /oauth2, /login/oauth2/code proxy) are matched BEFORE this
# catch-all, so this never shadows the API or the OAuth callback.
/*    /index.html    200
